# Production build config for the Static Web App.
# The SWA is Free SKU (no linked-backend proxy), so the browser calls the
# App Service API directly via this absolute base URL. Without it, the bundle
# falls back to same-origin "/api" (which the SWA cannot serve) and sign-in fails.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://supplymind.azurewebsites.net/api
